        "notes": "This is where it starts to get fun, for this round (if you havent won already) youll want to get  [Bomb Diffusal Boots](item_c555901e-1b69-4040-8420-ee81cbaf6d90) which will allow you to jump very high into the sky and become a harder target.\n\nHere you may want to balance out your damage and attack speed or id recommend keeping a little damage (10-20%) and trying to get as much ATK speed as you can afford.\n\nIf youre taking a lot of damage/dying a lot you can get  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) which would work very well as well as  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb), as you use your helix rocket to get visor, you get those extra buffs for a few seconds which can help do additional damage.\n\nWe will want to keep  [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) as well as  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) if they have armour or shields to provide that extra 25% ATK speed.",
